OL,3,AGlasgow City Council to fire and rehire
OL,4,Aover 23,000 employees
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe negotiations concerned plans by the
OL,7,Fcouncil to implement a new pay and
OL,8,Fgrading system, to replace one that was
OL,9,Ffound to discriminate against mostly
OL,10,Fwomen workers. However the move meant
OL,11,F11% of employees would see wages cut.
